From 4cf80a9ebc9249eb6ef3b7fcf360289ae6681019 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <2219838+mkinney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:53:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(edm): support explicit wire contour fan spans

Permit monotone sync spans with one stationary endpoint and preserve
whole-ring, duplicate, crossing and kerf refusals. Name unsupported
stitched profiles at their plane. Pin generation, verification and posting.

Fixes #1172

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
